cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BioCollaborator Health Informatics Programme"
message: "If you use this course material or the Ilanga synthetic dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gumede
    given-names: Thembelihle
    affiliation: BioCollaborator
repository-code: "https://github.com/BioCollaborator/ilanga-health-informatics"
abstract: >-
  A 16-module, Google Colab-based health informatics programme set in South Africa.
  Learners work as analysts for a fictional health data company serving a fully synthetic
  KwaZulu-Natal district, covering Python, POPIA, FHIR, SQL, routine indicators,
  laboratory informatics, knowledge graphs and machine learning.
keywords:
  - health informatics
  - digital health
  - South Africa
  - synthetic data
  - FHIR
  - POPIA
  - education
